        "caption": "#UniquelyMilwaukee - Tyrone Randle is one of six visual artists who competed in @trueskool414\u2019s live mural contest for Milwaukee\u2019s 55th annual Juneteenth celebration. \n\nTheir charge: interpret this year\u2019s Juneteenth theme: \u201cHonoring The Past. Empowering The Future.\u201d\n\n\u201cWe really count on these artists to tell a story because there\u2019s a gap in education,\u201d says Shalina Ali, True Skool\u2019s co-executive director.\n\n\u201cA lot of people understand that this is historically about freedom, but there\u2019s a layer of text and information that I think is really beneficial to people being proud of this celebration and understanding why Juneteenth is a celebration for America\u2026 What would this country be without a turning point like Juneteenth?\u201d\n\nListen to the full episode of Uniquely Milwaukee at  radiomilwaukee.org/ourstories or wherever you get your podcasts.\n\n#juneteenth #mural #milwaukee",
